    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\nSherry FitzGerald Draper are delighted to offer to the market this deceptively spacious handsome stone faced country residence with sizeable double garage situated in a quiet rural setting with beautiful uninterrupted views of the well-known Benwisken mountain.The well-appointed spacious accommodation comprises on the ground floor of an impressive large entrance hallway, cosy sitting room with fireplace & mountain views, large kitchen / dining room with extensive range of fitted kitchen units with island, handy utility room with fitted units, plumbing for washing machine & dryer, door to rear & door to the stairwell, three sizeable double bedrooms (one with ensuite) & a downstairs house bathroom.As you rise up the staircase you are met with a spacious landing area which could suit as a home office space. Off this area is a further two generous living rooms suitable for many uses.The property also has a very impressive B2 energy rating.The double garage is a special feature of this wonderful property as it is well finished out with concrete floor, plastered walls, loft space, electricity & two garage doors. The mature grounds of this fine home only serve to further enhance it, with mature planted border beds , elevated rear lawn area with good privacy surrounded by mature trees, colourful planting & hedging all with stunning uninterrupted views of Benwisken mountain. Located in the heart of an area of outstanding natural beauty in North County Sligo under the foot of Benwisken mountain situated in a quiet rural setting yet only 4km from Cliffoney village and 20km from Sligo city approx. with great amenities nearby including the rugged north west coastline with sandy beaches. Viewing highly recommended to really appreciate this wonderful property with stunning mountain views and all it has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 6.6m x 2m\nmountain views\n\nSitting room - 4.9m x 4.8m\nfeature fireplace, three large windows with mountain views, wooden flooring\n\nHallway (part 2) - 4.1m x 1.1m\nwooden flooring, hotpress shelved out\n\nKitchen / dining room - 5.8m x 4.8m\nextensive range of fitted kitchen units with large island, tiled flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m x 2.9m\nwooden flooring, mountain views\n\nHouse bathroom - 3.9m x 2m\nwc, whb, bath, wall & floor tiling\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.1m x 3.8m\nwooden flooring, mountain views\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.9m x 3.8m\nwooden flooring\n\nEnsuite - 2.6m x 1.8m\nwc, whb, shower, tiled walls, storage shelves\n\nUtility Room - 2.9m x 2m\nfitted units, plumbing for washing machine & dryer, door to rear, door to stairwell, tiled flooring\n\nStairwell - 2.8m x 1.8m\nstaircase\n\nLanding room - 3.9m x 3.7m\nskylight, attic storage access\n\nLiving Room - 4.6m x 3.8m\nmountain views\n\nLiving Room - 5.9m x 5m\n\n\nLarge double garage - 7.3m x 6.7m\nconcrete floor, plastered walls, electricity, two garage doors, loft storage space\n\n"
